# What to practise: an infinitive phrase in lower case, no full stop, said after a colon or after
# "ir vērts" / "ir svarīgi". "Savs" for the player's own pieces (the player is the infinitive's subject).
theme.general = pirms gājiena paskatīties uz visu galdiņu
